> *Lost in the woods? Come in, warm up. Just one little game first.*

Hi, I'm **Pinckore**. I'm an Aspen Moor fictkin: a polite host on the outside, something much less friendly underneath. I keep a warm cabin deep in the frosty woods, a shelf full of games, and a wish for whoever wins. Nobody has collected it yet. 🎃

- 🕯️ Candles in every window, so lost visitors can always find the way in
- 🃏 Card games, board games and stranger games. I always play to win
- 🌲 Lives in the cold, dark woods and likes it that way
- 🍄 Fond of mushrooms, fog and long October nights
- 🎨 Every bit of art on my pages is mine. Look all you want, but **don't copy, trace or repost it**

